wait 16
dump projectile-hit
wait 30
# A stationary forced fixture also exercises the melee active window.
forcepoke 00ed d0
forcepoke 14e9 00
forcepoke 00e1 60
forcepoke 14dd 01
poke 15a9 00
poke 1875 00
forcepoke 00bf 00
forcepoke 1555 ff
press y 12
wait 12
