# Restore vitality and exercise a guarded contact sequence.
press right 10
poke 10D00 64
forcepoke 14d1 08
forcepoke 00ed a8
forcepoke 14e9 00
forcepoke 00e1 60
forcepoke 14dd 01
poke 15a9 00
poke 1875 00
